WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:01.880
Hey guys,&nbsp;

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:08.960
You know in this day and age that we live in,&nbsp;
Christian men need to stand on God's Word.&nbsp;

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:10.840
And believe in it.
Trust in it.&nbsp;

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:15.120
More than anything else.
We need men who live by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:22.200
God-confidence and not self-confidence.
We are in a spiritual battle every day and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:26.960
you cannot let up for even a second.
You need to put on the armor of God&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:31.760
and fight with truth against all the&nbsp;
lies that are out there in the world.&nbsp;

00:00:31.760 --> 00:00:35.040
All the distractions.
And you need to run your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:44.480
race until the end to receive the crown of life.
But how can you fight if you don't know the truth?&nbsp;

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:47.000
God's Word?
Do you know His Word?&nbsp;

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:49.040
Do you read it?
Do you study it?&nbsp;

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.040
Do you live it?
Do you use it as part of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:57.120
the armor of God to fight back against the devil?
Because there are a lot of clever people in this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.120 --> 00:01:02.640
world who mix the truth with lies.
It can even be 99 percent truth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:09.080
and 1 percent lie and it can distract you.
It can deceive you, to go in the wrong direction.&nbsp;

00:01:09.080 --> 00:01:18.960
You know, the devil, when he tried to tempt Jesus,&nbsp;
he used the truth but he used it in the wrong way.&nbsp;

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:26.000
And Jesus didn't fall for his attacks,&nbsp;
because Jesus is the Word of God.&nbsp;

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:31.680
He couldn't deceive Jesus.
And what did Jesus do to fight back?&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:37.600
He quoted scripture every single time.
And the devil couldn't fight with that.&nbsp;

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:42.720
And that's why he left and&nbsp;
that's you need to do as well.

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:45.000
[2 Timothy 3:16-17]

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:13.200
He didn't say some of scripture was breathed&nbsp;
out by God - not 99 percent - he said all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:19.120
scripture was breathed out by God.
Do you understand how amazing this is?&nbsp;

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:23.400
The God of the universe.
It is His Word.&nbsp;

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.720
What He chose to reveal to us.&nbsp;

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:29.760
He wants us to know - understand&nbsp;
- and live by His truth.&nbsp;

00:02:31.240 --> 00:02:38.160
Man, this is so powerful and unfortunately a&nbsp;
lot of people today are being distracted by the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:41.560
busyness of this world.
And the devil.&nbsp;

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:47.640
And they don't study God's Word anymore.
So I want to plead with you today,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.640 --> 00:02:50.440
to study God's Word.
And to help you to do that,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.440 --> 00:02:54.160
to fight all the battles on this road&nbsp;
of sanctification that you are on.&nbsp;

00:02:54.160 --> 00:03:00.920
I want to give you five crucial important&nbsp;
Bible verses that I believe every man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:06.200
Christian man, should know.
Let's start with the first one.

00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.760
[1 Corinthians 16:13]

00:03:23.480 --> 00:03:29.760
Man, I love this verse.
It says that we have to be watchful.&nbsp;

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:33.320
Are you?
Are you always on guard, looking out?&nbsp;

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:36.000
Because we are in a battle.
Whether you like it or not.&nbsp;

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.960
And you need to be watchful.
You need to be careful.&nbsp;

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:45.280
You need to be on guard, being able to see&nbsp;
when evil is attacking you or your family.&nbsp;

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:49.000
