00:04:53.040 --> 00:04:53.440
[Titus 2:1]

00:04:53.440 --> 00:05:01.840
[2 Timothy 1:13]

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:17.720
To live and teach sound doctrine,&nbsp;
you need to know the Bible.&nbsp;

