00:07:19.280 --> 00:07:23.000
Because it is only the Word&nbsp;
of God that can set you free.&nbsp;

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:29.600
God's Word can change you if you read it.
If you absorb it and act on it.&nbsp;

00:07:29.600 --> 00:07:36.240
Which brings us to the next Bible verse:
Every Christian man should know:

00:07:36.240 --> 00:07:37.160
[James 1:22]

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:52.760
Every man must decide if he wants to&nbsp;
follow Jesus - the world - or his own will.&nbsp;

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:55.240
