00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:40.320
you come back to God's Word.
Continue the Bible study.

00:10:40.320 --> 00:10:42.240
[John 14: 21]

00:10:56.920 --> 00:11:00.400
If you pray to God and you're&nbsp;
wondering why does God not answer you?&nbsp;

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:03.280
