00:11:37.360 --> 00:11:42.480
Wow, it cannot be more clear than this.
You need to break with sin.&nbsp;

00:11:42.480 --> 00:11:47.440
We know and we understand that when we&nbsp;
repented, when we became a reborn Christian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:53.360
when God justified us as righteous, when we&nbsp;
