00:12:04.560 --> 00:12:09.920
Holy Spirit so when we do fall in sin, we&nbsp;
come back to the Father and we say Father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:09.920 --> 00:12:11.520
I have sinned.
I am sorry.&nbsp;

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:15.160
And then our relationship is&nbsp;
restored and we continue the walk.&nbsp;

00:12:15.160 --> 00:12:20.520
Being under the New Covenant means that we&nbsp;
