So, if you live according to the Spirit,&nbsp;
it means you're under the Spirit.&nbsp;

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:02.720
You are being obedient to God's Word.
You're being obedient to God, right?&nbsp;

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.920
Then you will not sin.
Now let me be very direct with you.&nbsp;

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:10.080
And let me ask you - are you&nbsp;
still living in the flesh?&nbsp;

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:14.120
Let's take a look at some of&nbsp;
