00:21:11.760 --> 00:21:17.200
Then you realize that all your plans&nbsp;
led you nowhere and pale in comparison&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:17.200 --> 00:21:23.000
to what God has in store for you, because&nbsp;
He knows you better than you know yourself.&nbsp;

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:27.760
He knows what you are capable of and what you&nbsp;
can accomplish in the future. This is where&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:34.960
you find meaning and fulfillment while&nbsp;
you live with eyes fully fixed on Jesus.&nbsp;

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:40.640
Where you find peace and all spiritual blessings.
You know, when I talk to certain Christians and I&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:40.640 --> 00:21:45.920
tell them we have already received all spiritual&nbsp;
blessings in Christ, some of them are like, what?&nbsp;

00:21:45.920 --> 00:21:49.680
What are those?
Because people do not read scripture anymore.&nbsp;

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:53.560
They don't understand this.
Being a Christian is not just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:21:53.560 --> 00:22:01.240
about finding salvation, it's about finding&nbsp;
true life and meaning in Jesus Christ.

00:22:01.240 --> 00:22:02.520
[Ephesians 1:3]

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.720
Man, this is so special.
When you reach this point, you start to realize,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:22:19.720 --> 00:22:24.720
man, life is not about me at all.
It's about Jesus.&nbsp;

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:29.640
And it has been about Him all along.
All the answers you search for.&nbsp;

00:22:29.640 --> 00:22:40.480
This world - everything is about Jesus.
And all you ever really needed was Him.&nbsp;

00:22:40.480 --> 00:22:47.000
To abide in Him, to truly&nbsp;
understand what that means.

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:05.520
[John 15:5-7]

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:29.960
You start to understand that&nbsp;
this is what life is all about.&nbsp;

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:35.960
This is where you find true joy and peace.
The things that humankind search for...&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:41.440
for thousands of years.
The answer was - is - and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:48.280
always will be - Jesus Christ.
It's amazing to think that the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:23:48.280 --> 00:23:55.520
world was created through Jesus for&nbsp;
Jesus and that He sustains everything.&nbsp;

00:23:55.520 --> 00:24:02.320
And He is far beyond what we can even try to&nbsp;
comprehend with our small three pound brains.&nbsp;

00:24:02.320 --> 00:24:08.800
And still this God chose to&nbsp;
come to us to be a personal God,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:13.280
to show us who He is because He&nbsp;
wants a relationship with us.

00:24:18.240 --> 00:24:19.120
[John 15:11]

00:24:24.640 --> 00:24:28.120
When you reach this point&nbsp;
of truly abiding in Christ,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:28.120 --> 00:24:38.400
you don't worry and have anxiety or stress about&nbsp;
the normal things that still affect people today.&nbsp;

00:24:38.400 --> 00:24:42.680
You start to see the whole picture of life.
The devil.&nbsp;

00:24:42.680 --> 00:24:47.240
This world can do nothing to you.
Because you are in Christ.&nbsp;

00:24:47.240 --> 00:24:52.040
The normal things that used to influence you and&nbsp;
that still influence other people today do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:52.040 --> 00:24:55.760
influence you anymore.
Let me explain.&nbsp;

00:24:55.760 --> 00:24:58.880
There are people who claim to be&nbsp;
Christians but they still live according&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:24:58.880 --> 00:25:04.160
to their own will, focused on the self-life.
Living selfishly, always having issues and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:04.160 --> 00:25:08.480
struggles, complaining about this, complaining&nbsp;
about that, complaining about everything.&nbsp;

00:25:08.480 --> 00:25:13.880
They say things like - oh, this is just who I am.
So don't expect me to change.&nbsp;

00:25:13.880 --> 00:25:17.320
Or, this is my child and I&nbsp;
will raise him as I want to.&nbsp;

00:25:17.320 --> 00:25:24.200
Or, it is my money so I will do it as I want to.
Or, I'm not going to forgive this person.&nbsp;

00:25:24.200 --> 00:25:31.560
They need to come to me or I am never wrong or&nbsp;
just do what I told you because I'm your husband&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:25:31.560 --> 00:25:36.280
or I'm your father.
I-I-I&nbsp;

00:25:36.280 --> 00:25:44.240
So full of pride and God hates pride.
You need to come to the end of that I.&nbsp;

00:25:44.240 --> 00:25:45.760
To the end of yourself.&nbsp;

00:25:45.760 --> 00:25:54.360
That I needs to be broken by Christ.
So that you can say like Jesus.

00:25:54.360 --> 00:25:56.600
[Luke 22:42]

00:26:02.400 --> 00:26:05.680
You know, all those things that&nbsp;
you feel so "I- I- I" about.&nbsp;

00:26:05.680 --> 00:26:10.040
Even the I He has given that to you.
He has given you life.&nbsp;

00:26:10.040 --> 00:26:16.880
He's given you a self-determining will,&nbsp;
because He wants you to choose Him out of love.&nbsp;

00:26:16.880 --> 00:26:24.080
He wants you to put Him first in everything.
To say like Paul in Galatians 2:20.

00:26:25.960 --> 00:26:27.200
[Galatians 2:20]

00:26:31.800 --> 00:26:38.600
You know, certain men don't really have these&nbsp;
issues, because they struggle with being a good&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:38.600 --> 00:26:42.800
father, or a good son, or a good husband.
Or they struggle to be this or that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:26:42.800 --> 00:26:49.640
because of the reasons they think.
It is because of the self-life.&nbsp;

00:26:49.640 --> 00:26:55.280
That is why they struggle when you&nbsp;
deny yourself, including your past.&nbsp;

00:26:55.280 --> 00:26:59.760
You sort it out with God once and for all.
You repent, ask Him to forgive everything.&nbsp;

00:26:59.760 --> 00:27:00.560
He does.
He doesn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:00.560 --> 00:27:02.600
even think about it anymore.
It makes you a new creation.&nbsp;

00:27:02.600 --> 00:27:07.880
You start to live in the spirit.
You are a new creation.&nbsp;

00:27:07.880 --> 00:27:11.200
You need to understand what that means.
It means that you are not the same anymore.&nbsp;

00:27:11.200 --> 00:27:16.280
You need to forgive yourself, you need to move on.
When you do, you start to live through the Spirit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:16.280 --> 00:27:21.440
and you have true love in you. Unconditional&nbsp;
agape love, because it is the love that God&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:21.440 --> 00:27:25.440
has given to you through the Spirit.
The love that you now have for God.&nbsp;

00:27:25.440 --> 00:27:29.600
And for other people.
And that will help you to be a good father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:27:29.600 --> 00:27:35.720
a good husband, a good son, a good everything.
Because you do it through the Spirit now.&nbsp;

00:27:35.720 --> 00:27:41.720
Your new nature.
And that takes us to the next verse:

00:27:41.720 --> 00:27:43.920
[Matthew 7:12]

00:27:53.680 --> 00:27:56.600
Now many of you know that this&nbsp;
is also called the golden rule.&nbsp;

00:27:56.600 --> 00:28:01.960
And if you follow this golden rule, you will&nbsp;
automatically also obey most of the other laws.&nbsp;

00:28:01.960 --> 00:28:05.680
For example, you won't kill someone&nbsp;
because you don't want someone to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:05.680 --> 00:28:10.600
kill you. You won't steal something because&nbsp;
you don't want someone to steal from you.&nbsp;

00:28:10.600 --> 00:28:16.080
You won't curse or swear at someone because&nbsp;
you don't want someone to do that to you.&nbsp;

00:28:16.080 --> 00:28:20.240
When you receive the agape love from&nbsp;
God, through the Spirit that is in you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:20.240 --> 00:28:24.800
you start to truly love other people.
Because it is God that is helping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:24.800 --> 00:28:27.920
you and loving people through you.
That is how you are able to be the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:28:27.920 --> 00:28:33.560
light and start to look so differently at other&nbsp;
people, realizing that they are sinners, right?&nbsp;

00:28:33.560 --> 00:28:38.080
You don't love the sin but you love&nbsp;
them and you want them to be safe.&nbsp;

00:28:38.760 --> 00:28:45.520
You start to live a life that is unselfish.
Selfless.&nbsp;

00:28:45.520 --> 00:28:52.520
You realize that people love them just as much&nbsp;
as He loves you and wants them to be saved.&nbsp;

00:28:52.520 --> 00:28:57.120
That is why so many mature Christians truly&nbsp;
love other people and want to help them.&nbsp;

00:28:57.120 --> 00:29:01.640
And that is how you will live as&nbsp;
well, if God's Spirit is in you.

00:29:01.640 --> 00:29:02.960
[Philippians 2:3]

00:29:25.280 --> 00:29:30.960
So many Christians out there are are so selfish&nbsp;
because they still live according to their&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:30.960 --> 00:29:38.720
self-life and it causes a lot of hurt.
Unnecessary hurt.&nbsp;

00:29:38.720 --> 00:29:44.080
But if you live through the Spirit, through&nbsp;
God's love, it changes everything. Because then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:29:44.080 --> 00:29:51.520
you actually start to put yourself in their shoes&nbsp;
and understand how they feel about certain things.&nbsp;

00:29:51.520 --> 00:29:57.320
My wife, if I were in her position,&nbsp;
what would she need from me right now?&nbsp;

00:29:58.600 --> 00:30:05.600
My son, if I were in his position, how&nbsp;
would I want my father to speak to me?&nbsp;

00:30:05.600 --> 00:30:09.040
You see, you start to look at things&nbsp;
from their perspective and then together&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:09.040 --> 00:30:13.280
with the Spirit in you that gives you the&nbsp;
ability to truly speak into their lives,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:13.280 --> 00:30:17.400
you start to think and act differently.
Because you first ask God how do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:17.400 --> 00:30:21.960
you want me to handle this situation?
What do you want me to give to this person?&nbsp;

00:30:21.960 --> 00:30:27.240
What do they need from me right now?
It is not about you at all anymore,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:28.240 --> 00:30:30.760
because you love God's Word.
And because He is in you,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:30.760 --> 00:30:34.360
you start to obey verses like these.
To think of others as more&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:34.360 --> 00:30:38.760
significant than yourself.
Not to live a selfish life.&nbsp;

00:30:38.760 --> 00:30:42.480
And you start to especially take&nbsp;
verses like these seriously.

00:30:42.480 --> 00:30:43.360
[1 Timothy 5:8]

00:30:56.200 --> 00:30:57.240
[1 Peter 3:7]

00:31:13.240 --> 00:31:15.640
[Colossians 3: 21]

00:31:21.720 --> 00:31:26.640
So you start with your household.
You lead with gentleness.&nbsp;

00:31:26.640 --> 00:31:28.400
With love.
There are too many Christian&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:28.400 --> 00:31:32.920
men out there who are harsh.
Too harsh with their kids.&nbsp;

00:31:32.920 --> 00:31:37.760
Too legalistic.
And you're pushing them away from God.&nbsp;

00:31:37.760 --> 00:31:43.200
How dare you.
Yes, you need to teach the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:43.200 --> 00:31:48.520
truth in love and bring them to Christ.
You need to be the example.&nbsp;

00:31:48.520 --> 00:31:53.560
You need to be as Jesus.
You need to follow in the footsteps of Jesus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:31:53.560 --> 00:32:01.000
and be to your family as Christ is to the church.
That is a huge responsibility but you can do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:01.000 --> 00:32:08.080
it through Christ that gives you strength.
You need to follow God's will for your family.&nbsp;

00:32:08.080 --> 00:32:12.720
And it doesn't matter how you were brought up&nbsp;
and you have excuses like, oh I didn't have a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:12.720 --> 00:32:16.080
good example like this or that.
Well, you have the most&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:16.080 --> 00:32:24.080
perfect example: Jesus Himself.
And through the Spirit, you can do it.&nbsp;

00:32:24.080 --> 00:32:27.080
Through the flesh we cannot.
We will struggle.&nbsp;

00:32:27.800 --> 00:32:32.440
We need to learn to do it through the Spirit.
You can be a great father.&nbsp;

00:32:32.440 --> 00:32:38.040
You can be a great son.
And you can be a great husband.&nbsp;

00:32:38.040 --> 00:32:44.040
But then there comes a point where you also&nbsp;
understand, it's not just about your family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:32:44.040 --> 00:32:52.600
but about everyone God sends on your path.
Even people you don't like, with your self-life.

00:32:52.600 --> 00:32:54.200
[Matthew 5:43}

00:33:36.160 --> 00:33:39.040
Do you understand?
If you only care about your own family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:39.040 --> 00:33:44.080
members then you are just the same as unbelievers&nbsp;
who care about their family members and they don't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:44.080 --> 00:33:48.840
care about other people outside their family.
They always just put their family first and they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:33:48.840 --> 00:33:53.520
will even murder, kill, steal, and bribe&nbsp;
just to get ahead for their own family.&nbsp;

00:33:53.520 --> 00:34:02.120
And that's why we have so much suffering in&nbsp;
the world because people commit terrible acts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:02.120 --> 00:34:06.400
just to try and help their own family&nbsp;
but they're willing to do those acts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:06.400 --> 00:34:11.040
against other people with other families.
But you are supposed to be different.&nbsp;

00:34:11.040 --> 00:34:14.160
You are a true reborn Christian.
Will look after your own family but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:34:14.160 --> 00:34:20.200
also care about other people out there.
You will want people to be saved.&nbsp;

00:34:20.200 --> 00:34:26.880
You will want to make disciples of all people&nbsp;
and all nations because God's love is in you.

00:34:33.400 --> 00:34:35.080
[Matthew 5:48]

00:34:37.720 --> 00:34:39.640
Now, let me just pray for you.&nbsp;

00:34:39.640 --> 00:34:44.720
Father, I want to ask you to please bless&nbsp;
this person who is watching this video.&nbsp;

00:34:44.720 --> 00:34:50.520
Please change them.
Create a fire within them for You.&nbsp;

00:34:50.520 --> 00:34:54.440
To truly follow You.
Radical discipleship.&nbsp;

00:34:54.440 --> 00:34:56.240
To follow Jesus.
You.&nbsp;

00:34:56.240 --> 00:35:02.120
No matter the cost to truly love&nbsp;
other people out there as well.&nbsp;

00:35:02.120 --> 00:35:08.880
Please Father, bless them.
Use this video, this sermon, for Your glory.&nbsp;

00:35:08.880 --> 00:35:11.320
Amen.
If you&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:35:11.320 --> 00:35:18.400
want to grow in Christ and need help, please&nbsp;
watch these videos here and it will help you.&nbsp;

00:35:18.400 --> 00:35:23.960
God loves you, and I love you, too.
Bye.

